stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: Dashboard Loaded

    Idle --> FetchingData: Initial Load
    FetchingData --> DisplayingData: Data Fetched
    DisplayingData --> MonitoringDeployment: Deployment Detected

    MonitoringDeployment --> QualityGatesStage: Stage: Quality Gates
    QualityGatesStage --> QualityGatesPassed: All Checks Pass
    QualityGatesStage --> QualityGatesFailed: Checks Failed

    QualityGatesFailed --> DisplayingError: Show Error Details
    DisplayingError --> AwaitingUserAction: Suggest Remediation

    QualityGatesPassed --> DockerBuildStage: Stage: Docker Build
    DockerBuildStage --> DockerBuildComplete: Build Success
    DockerBuildStage --> DockerBuildFailed: Build Failed

    DockerBuildFailed --> DisplayingError

    DockerBuildComplete --> DeploymentStage: Stage: Staging Deploy
    DeploymentStage --> HealthChecking: Deployment Complete
    HealthChecking --> HealthChecksPassed: All Healthy
    HealthChecking --> HealthChecksFailed: Health Check Failed

    HealthChecksFailed --> AutoRollback: Trigger Automatic Rollback
    AutoRollback --> RollbackInProgress: Rolling Back...
    RollbackInProgress --> RollbackComplete: Rollback Success
    RollbackComplete --> DisplayingError

    HealthChecksPassed --> SmokeTestStage: Stage: Smoke Tests
    SmokeTestStage --> SmokeTestsRunning: Running 28 Tests
    SmokeTestsRunning --> SmokeTestsPassed: 28/28 Passed
    SmokeTestsRunning --> SmokeTestsFailed: Tests Failed

    SmokeTestsFailed --> AutoRollback

    SmokeTestsPassed --> TrafficShiftStage: Stage: Traffic Shift
    TrafficShiftStage --> TrafficShift10: 10% Traffic
    TrafficShift10 --> MonitoringMetrics: Monitor Error Rate
    MonitoringMetrics --> MetricsHealthy: Error Rate < 5%
    MonitoringMetrics --> MetricsUnhealthy: Error Rate >= 5%

    MetricsUnhealthy --> AutoRollback

    MetricsHealthy --> TrafficShift50: 50% Traffic
    TrafficShift50 --> MonitoringMetrics50: Monitor Metrics
    MonitoringMetrics50 --> Metrics50Healthy: Healthy
    MonitoringMetrics50 --> Metrics50Unhealthy: Unhealthy

    Metrics50Unhealthy --> AutoRollback

    Metrics50Healthy --> TrafficShift100: 100% Traffic
    TrafficShift100 --> FinalValidation: Final Validation
    FinalValidation --> DeploymentSuccess: All Checks Pass
    FinalValidation --> ValidationFailed: Validation Failed

    ValidationFailed --> AutoRollback

    DeploymentSuccess --> CollectingMetrics: Update Metrics
    CollectingMetrics --> NotifyingTeam: Send Slack Notification
    NotifyingTeam --> DisplayingSuccess: Show Success Status
    DisplayingSuccess --> MonitoringProduction: Continuous Monitoring

    MonitoringProduction --> MonitoringProduction: Health Checks Every 30s
    MonitoringProduction --> ProductionIssue: Issue Detected
    ProductionIssue --> AwaitingUserAction: Alert Team

    AwaitingUserAction --> ManualRollback: User Triggers Rollback
    ManualRollback --> RollbackInProgress

    AwaitingUserAction --> RetryDeployment: User Retries
    RetryDeployment --> QualityGatesStage

    AwaitingUserAction --> InvestigatingIssue: View Logs & Errors
    InvestigatingIssue --> AwaitingUserAction: User Decides Next Action

    DisplayingSuccess --> Idle: No Active Deployment
    RollbackComplete --> Idle: Deployment Rolled Back

    note right of QualityGatesStage
        Runs:
        - ESLint checks
        - TypeScript type checking
        - Unit tests
        - Security scans
        - Circular dependency check
        Duration: ~5-7 minutes
    end note

    note right of DockerBuildStage
        Runs:
        - Multi-stage Docker build
        - Multi-arch (amd64, arm64)
        - Trivy security scan
        - Image signing (Cosign)
        - SBOM generation
        - Push to GHCR
        Duration: ~3-5 minutes
    end note

    note right of DeploymentStage
        Runs:
        - Blue-green deployment
        - Database migrations
        - Service startup
        - Initial health checks
        Duration: ~3-5 minutes
    end note

    note right of SmokeTestStage
        Runs:
        - 28 automated smoke tests
        - API endpoint tests
        - Database connectivity
        - Cache functionality
        - Auth flow
        Duration: ~2-3 minutes
    end note

    note right of TrafficShiftStage
        Progressive shift:
        - 10% → wait 2 min → validate
        - 50% → wait 2 min → validate
        - 100% → final validation
        Duration: ~5-7 minutes
    end note

    note left of AutoRollback
        Automatic rollback triggers:
        - Health check failures (3 consecutive)
        - Error rate > 5% (2 min)
        - Response time P95 > 1000ms
        - Smoke test failures
        Rollback time: < 2 minutes
    end note

    note left of ManualRollback
        Manual rollback actions:
        - Emergency rollback button
        - Requires confirmation
        - One-click execution
        - Real-time progress
        Rollback time: < 2 minutes
    end note
